--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. YOUR TEXT STAYS YOURS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Switcher3way reads keystrokes and rewrites text locally, on your computer, in
order to do its job. It transmits no keystrokes, no text and no personal data to
IronMade or to anyone else. Its only network activity is checking for updates,
which you can switch off. Licence validation is performed offline.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. TERM AND TERMINATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This Agreement runs until terminated. It terminates automatically if you breach
Section 2. On termination you must stop using Switcher3way and remove it. A
trial that expires, or an annual licence that lapses, ends the licence granted
in Section 1 but does not by itself terminate this Agreement.

